# --- E-Trace back end ------------------------------------------------------
# Written 2026-08-07 and never run in a stage until 2026-08-19: the E-Trace
# back end was claimed in the documentation and proven only by hand. `etrace`
# drives thirteen scenarios through XSIM and prefix-compares the decoded PC
# sequence against the cpu_model oracle; `etrace_ctxp` checks the CTXP export
# of the same path.
etrace
etrace_ctxp
